[
 {
  "start": 1.39576,
  "end": 2.640522,
  "sil_before": [
   0.0,
   1.39576
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   2.640522,
   3.025283
  ],
  "i": 0,
  "text": "So what is quant?"
 },
 {
  "start": 3.025283,
  "end": 11.242608,
  "sil_before": [
   2.640522,
   3.025283
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   11.242608,
   12.14381
  ],
  "i": 1,
  "text": "This is something I've been recommended for quite some time, right? People from my community, people in my live streams dropping comments saying I should buy some quants."
 },
 {
  "start": 12.14381,
  "end": 21.041406,
  "sil_before": [
   11.242608,
   12.14381
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   21.041406,
   21.610658
  ],
  "i": 2,
  "text": "And I always say, you know, it looks pretty good and so on, but there's so many tokens, I can't buy everything, but I wanna get into this and do a deep dive into this. And..."
 },
 {
  "start": 21.610658,
  "end": 22.676009,
  "sil_before": [
   21.041406,
   21.610658
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   22.676009,
   31.61093
  ],
  "i": 3,
  "text": "Just break it all down."
 },
 {
  "start": 31.61093,
  "end": 39.694671,
  "sil_before": [
   22.676009,
   31.61093
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   39.694671,
   40.499819
  ],
  "i": 4,
  "text": "Right, so here's the short version. Kwan is a London company founded in 2015 by a guy named Gilbert Veridian."
 },
 {
  "start": 40.499819,
  "end": 43.595079,
  "sil_before": [
   39.694671,
   40.499819
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   43.595079,
   45.947778
  ],
  "i": 5,
  "text": "and what they sell is not a new blockchain."
 },
 {
  "start": 45.947778,
  "end": 49.945034,
  "sil_before": [
   43.595079,
   45.947778
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   49.945034,
   53.664717
  ],
  "i": 6,
  "text": "It's a software layer that sits on top of the systems the bank already runs."
 },
 {
  "start": 53.664717,
  "end": 58.094036,
  "sil_before": [
   49.945034,
   53.664717
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   58.094036,
   59.104739
  ],
  "i": 7,
  "text": "and it connects them to the blockchains and the digital money networks that are out there."
 },
 {
  "start": 59.104739,
  "end": 63.267506,
  "sil_before": [
   58.094036,
   59.104739
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   63.267506,
   64.344943
  ],
  "i": 8,
  "text": "Their customers are banks, financial institutions, and capital markets."
 },
 {
  "start": 64.344943,
  "end": 71.438254,
  "sil_before": [
   63.267506,
   64.344943
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   71.438254,
   74.948481
  ],
  "i": 9,
  "text": "And by the end of this, you're going to know who exactly is using it, what the token does, and where it sits for the rest of the world."
 },
 {
  "start": 74.948481,
  "end": 76.48229,
  "sil_before": [
   71.438254,
   74.948481
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   76.48229,
   84.59195
  ],
  "i": 10,
  "text": "So let's walk through all of this."
 },
 {
  "start": 84.59195,
  "end": 88.681565,
  "sil_before": [
   76.48229,
   84.59195
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   88.681565,
   89.056054
  ],
  "i": 11,
  "text": "Now to understand why Quan exists, think of every bank as an island."
 },
 {
  "start": 89.056054,
  "end": 90.536553,
  "sil_before": [
   88.681565,
   89.056054
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   90.536553,
   91.1
  ],
  "i": 12,
  "text": "Each island has its own vogue."
 },
 {
  "start": 91.1,
  "end": 91.900431,
  "sil_before": [
   90.536553,
   91.1
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   91.900431,
   92.644626
  ],
  "i": 13,
  "text": "and his own ledger."
 },
 {
  "start": 92.644626,
  "end": 95.890159,
  "sil_before": [
   91.900431,
   92.644626
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   95.890159,
   99.096735
  ],
  "i": 14,
  "text": "and the money on one island just can't rock over to the next one."
 },
 {
  "start": 99.096735,
  "end": 99.955215,
  "sil_before": [
   95.890159,
   99.096735
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   99.955215,
   100.515601
  ],
  "i": 15,
  "text": "It goes on a boat."
 },
 {
  "start": 100.515601,
  "end": 104.460794,
  "sil_before": [
   99.955215,
   100.515601
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   104.460794,
   121.057234
  ],
  "i": 16,
  "text": "one payment, one leg at a time, and that boat can take days."
 },
 {
  "start": 121.057234,
  "end": 123.438594,
  "sil_before": [
   104.460794,
   121.057234
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   123.438594,
   124.124172
  ],
  "i": 17,
  "text": "Now the banks are turning those deposits digital."
 },
 {
  "start": 124.124172,
  "end": 127.392948,
  "sil_before": [
   123.438594,
   124.124172
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   127.392948,
   127.743741
  ],
  "i": 18,
  "text": "A tokenized deposit is still your deposit at your bank."
 },
 {
  "start": 127.743741,
  "end": 129.632154,
  "sil_before": [
   127.392948,
   127.743741
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   129.632154,
   130.088844
  ],
  "i": 19,
  "text": "Same protections, same regulator."
 },
 {
  "start": 130.088844,
  "end": 131.334354,
  "sil_before": [
   129.632154,
   130.088844
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   131.334354,
   135.380998
  ],
  "i": 20,
  "text": "It's just recorded differently."
 },
 {
  "start": 135.380998,
  "end": 136.83712,
  "sil_before": [
   131.334354,
   135.380998
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   136.83712,
   142.372313
  ],
  "i": 21,
  "text": "and it can carry rules."
 },
 {
  "start": 142.372313,
  "end": 145.547007,
  "sil_before": [
   136.83712,
   142.372313
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   145.547007,
   146.358141
  ],
  "i": 22,
  "text": "like move when this happens, release when that happens."
 },
 {
  "start": 150.161701,
  "end": 154.180249,
  "sil_before": [
   146.537982,
   150.161701
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   154.180249,
   157.595669
  ],
  "i": 23,
  "text": "But here's the thing though, right now most of them only move inside the bank that issued them."
 },
 {
  "start": 157.595669,
  "end": 159.084172,
  "sil_before": [
   154.180249,
   157.595669
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   159.084172,
   159.620045
  ],
  "i": 24,
  "text": "Quince own words for it."
 },
 {
  "start": 159.620045,
  "end": 160.754104,
  "sil_before": [
   159.084172,
   159.620045
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   160.754104,
   161.694694
  ],
  "i": 25,
  "text": "World Gardens."
 },
 {
  "start": 161.694694,
  "end": 162.60356,
  "sil_before": [
   160.754104,
   161.694694
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   162.60356,
   163.024376
  ],
  "i": 26,
  "text": "Same islands."
 },
 {
  "start": 163.024376,
  "end": 164.012109,
  "sil_before": [
   162.60356,
   163.024376
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   164.012109,
   174.863628
  ],
  "i": 27,
  "text": "Brand new fences."
 },
 {
  "start": 174.863628,
  "end": 181.329138,
  "sil_before": [
   164.012109,
   174.863628
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   181.329138,
   190.006531
  ],
  "i": 28,
  "text": "So the obvious move would be to build one more island, one big chain, tell every bank, come and settle over here."
 },
 {
  "start": 190.006531,
  "end": 191.845215,
  "sil_before": [
   181.329138,
   190.006531
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   191.845215,
   192.162222
  ],
  "i": 29,
  "text": "And that is exactly what quant."
 },
 {
  "start": 192.162222,
  "end": 193.289048,
  "sil_before": [
   191.845215,
   192.162222
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   193.289048,
   193.69254
  ],
  "i": 30,
  "text": "did not do."
 },
 {
  "start": 193.69254,
  "end": 196.05898,
  "sil_before": [
   193.289048,
   193.69254
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   196.05898,
   199.671859
  ],
  "i": 31,
  "text": "Quan is the layer that sits above the islands."
 },
 {
  "start": 199.671859,
  "end": 204.162494,
  "sil_before": [
   196.05898,
   199.671859
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   204.162494,
   206.238707
  ],
  "i": 32,
  "text": "The bank keeps its core systems, keeps its payment rails, keeps custody of the money."
 },
 {
  "start": 206.238707,
  "end": 210.336576,
  "sil_before": [
   204.162494,
   206.238707
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   210.336576,
   211.911497
  ],
  "i": 33,
  "text": "Quant connects all of that through a set of APIs and orchestrates the movement."
 },
 {
  "start": 211.911497,
  "end": 213.603946,
  "sil_before": [
   210.336576,
   211.911497
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   213.603946,
   222.892018
  ],
  "i": 34,
  "text": "and it never holds the funds."
 },
 {
  "start": 222.892018,
  "end": 225.084807,
  "sil_before": [
   213.603946,
   222.892018
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   225.084807,
   226.566508
  ],
  "i": 35,
  "text": "Now what does that look like for one payment?"
 },
 {
  "start": 226.566508,
  "end": 227.662358,
  "sil_before": [
   225.084807,
   226.566508
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   227.662358,
   228.049229
  ],
  "i": 36,
  "text": ""
 },
 {
  "start": 228.049229,
  "end": 231.258277,
  "sil_before": [
   227.662358,
   228.049229
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   231.258277,
   231.70907
  ],
  "i": 37,
  "text": "A manufacturer in London paying a supplier in Singapore."
 },
 {
  "start": 231.70907,
  "end": 232.437528,
  "sil_before": [
   231.258277,
   231.70907
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   232.437528,
   232.822676
  ],
  "i": 38,
  "text": "Step one."
 },
 {
  "start": 232.822676,
  "end": 233.311429,
  "sil_before": [
   232.437528,
   232.822676
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   233.311429,
   234.03068
  ],
  "i": 39,
  "text": "luck."
 },
 {
  "start": 234.03068,
  "end": 238.031565,
  "sil_before": [
   233.311429,
   234.03068
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   238.031565,
   238.616054
  ],
  "i": 40,
  "text": "The London bank locks the manufacturer's money the moment it accepts the instruction."
 },
 {
  "start": 238.616054,
  "end": 239.79,
  "sil_before": [
   238.031565,
   238.616054
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   239.79,
   240.441587
  ],
  "i": 41,
  "text": "Step 2. Credit."
 },
 {
  "start": 240.441587,
  "end": 244.583787,
  "sil_before": [
   239.79,
   240.441587
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   244.583787,
   245.026825
  ],
  "i": 42,
  "text": "The Singapore bank credits the supplier right away against that lock."
 },
 {
  "start": 245.026825,
  "end": 245.712698,
  "sil_before": [
   244.583787,
   245.026825
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   245.712698,
   246.249524
  ],
  "i": 43,
  "text": "Step three."
 },
 {
  "start": 246.249524,
  "end": 246.678866,
  "sil_before": [
   245.712698,
   246.249524
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   246.678866,
   247.356281
  ],
  "i": 44,
  "text": "Subtle."
 },
 {
  "start": 247.356281,
  "end": 251.686576,
  "sil_before": [
   246.678866,
   247.356281
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   251.686576,
   253.88712
  ],
  "i": 45,
  "text": "The two banks settle with each other in the next window, and the lock is released."
 },
 {
  "start": 253.88712,
  "end": 256.925669,
  "sil_before": [
   251.686576,
   253.88712
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   256.925669,
   257.424807
  ],
  "i": 46,
  "text": "No new asset and the money never left the banking system."
 },
 {
  "start": 257.424807,
  "end": 260.768617,
  "sil_before": [
   256.925669,
   257.424807
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   260.768617,
   271.567483
  ],
  "i": 47,
  "text": "It was a deposit at a regulated bank the whole way."
 },
 {
  "start": 271.567483,
  "end": 273.819887,
  "sil_before": [
   260.768617,
   271.567483
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   273.819887,
   276.181701
  ],
  "i": 48,
  "text": "And the second trick is a synchronized settlement."
 },
 {
  "start": 276.181701,
  "end": 281.88458,
  "sil_before": [
   273.819887,
   276.181701
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   281.88458,
   284.666077
  ],
  "i": 49,
  "text": "The old way settles each leg of the deal on its own. So one leg clears, the other one hasn't yet."
 },
 {
  "start": 284.666077,
  "end": 286.717506,
  "sil_before": [
   281.88458,
   284.666077
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   286.717506,
   287.811406
  ],
  "i": 50,
  "text": "And for a moment the whole deal sits in limbo."
 },
 {
  "start": 287.811406,
  "end": 291.337823,
  "sil_before": [
   286.717506,
   287.811406
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   291.337823,
   294.207982
  ],
  "i": 51,
  "text": "With this layer, every bank involved reserve this funds first."
 },
 {
  "start": 294.207982,
  "end": 295.972472,
  "sil_before": [
   291.337823,
   294.207982
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   295.972472,
   296.362676
  ],
  "i": 52,
  "text": "and then every leg commits together."
 },
 {
  "start": 296.362676,
  "end": 297.189025,
  "sil_before": [
   295.972472,
   296.362676
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   297.189025,
   303.362971
  ],
  "i": 53,
  "text": "Or none of them do."
 },
 {
  "start": 303.362971,
  "end": 306.259252,
  "sil_before": [
   297.189025,
   303.362971
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   306.259252,
   307.648957
  ],
  "i": 54,
  "text": "And if that was a bit complex, I feel you, bro."
 },
 {
  "start": 307.648957,
  "end": 312.625306,
  "sil_before": [
   306.259252,
   307.648957
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   312.625306,
   326.164853
  ],
  "i": 55,
  "text": "Feel free to double tap the left side of this video if you're on your phone to go back and watch it all over again."
 },
 {
  "start": 326.164853,
  "end": 328.276054,
  "sil_before": [
   312.625306,
   326.164853
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   328.276054,
   331.276803
  ],
  "i": 56,
  "text": "Now, here's the thing with the real names."
 },
 {
  "start": 331.276803,
  "end": 335.821927,
  "sil_before": [
   328.276054,
   331.276803
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   335.821927,
   336.833923
  ],
  "i": 57,
  "text": "On the left, what a bank already runs. Core banking, treasury, the payment rails."
 },
 {
  "start": 336.833923,
  "end": 337.994127,
  "sil_before": [
   335.821927,
   336.833923
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   337.994127,
   340.957211
  ],
  "i": 58,
  "text": "In the middle, clout."
 },
 {
  "start": 340.957211,
  "end": 342.795193,
  "sil_before": [
   337.994127,
   340.957211
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   342.795193,
   345.407234
  ],
  "i": 59,
  "text": "Overledger is the API connector."
 },
 {
  "start": 345.407234,
  "end": 349.57932,
  "sil_before": [
   342.795193,
   345.407234
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   349.57932,
   350.436644
  ],
  "i": 60,
  "text": "Quant flow is where the bank writes the rules, in their own payment language, pay script."
 },
 {
  "start": 350.436644,
  "end": 353.468776,
  "sil_before": [
   349.57932,
   350.436644
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   353.468776,
   354.429751
  ],
  "i": 61,
  "text": "Quantinet is the orchestration layer, coordinated in the islands."
 },
 {
  "start": 354.429751,
  "end": 358.387415,
  "sil_before": [
   353.468776,
   354.429751
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   358.387415,
   358.950907
  ],
  "i": 62,
  "text": "QuantFusion is their roll-up, live on mainnet since June 2nd."
 },
 {
  "start": 358.950907,
  "end": 360.011927,
  "sil_before": [
   358.387415,
   358.950907
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   360.011927,
   360.61712
  ],
  "i": 63,
  "text": "2026."
 },
 {
  "start": 360.61712,
  "end": 362.362086,
  "sil_before": [
   360.011927,
   360.61712
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   362.362086,
   363.687732
  ],
  "i": 64,
  "text": "Connected to 74 networks."
 },
 {
  "start": 363.687732,
  "end": 367.224989,
  "sil_before": [
   362.362086,
   363.687732
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   367.224989,
   391.951066
  ],
  "i": 65,
  "text": "and on the right, the ledgers and the tokenized deposit platforms."
 },
 {
  "start": 391.951066,
  "end": 393.533832,
  "sil_before": [
   367.224989,
   391.951066
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   393.533832,
   394.480227
  ],
  "i": 66,
  "text": "So who's actually using this?"
 },
 {
  "start": 394.480227,
  "end": 395.669138,
  "sil_before": [
   393.533832,
   394.480227
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   395.669138,
   396.768367
  ],
  "i": 67,
  "text": "Let's start with the founder."
 },
 {
  "start": 396.768367,
  "end": 397.915283,
  "sil_before": [
   395.669138,
   396.768367
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   397.915283,
   400.794286
  ],
  "i": 68,
  "text": "Gilbert Verdean."
 },
 {
  "start": 400.794286,
  "end": 403.557029,
  "sil_before": [
   397.915283,
   400.794286
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   403.557029,
   404.380658
  ],
  "i": 69,
  "text": "He's a cyber security guy, more than 20 years of it."
 },
 {
  "start": 404.380658,
  "end": 406.315374,
  "sil_before": [
   403.557029,
   404.380658
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   406.315374,
   407.100771
  ],
  "i": 70,
  "text": "And he's been a security chief at that level."
 },
 {
  "start": 407.100771,
  "end": 410.753605,
  "sil_before": [
   406.315374,
   407.100771
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   410.753605,
   411.138662
  ],
  "i": 71,
